# Egg Alpha — findings by Step 5 Preview (self-excluded: anonymous model with zero verified public benchmarks)

- Source: 基元律动 / Token Rhythm platform (anonymous "Egg Alpha" listing; identity undisclosed)
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Egg Alpha (anonymous / stealth listing)
- **Short description:** An anonymous model listed on the Chinese 基元律动 (Token Rhythm) platform and accessed through the open-source Pi agent framework — a single informal six-task evaluation exists; identity, parameters, and every standard benchmark are undisclosed.
- **Provider / access:** `https://tokenrhythm.studio/models` (基元律动 / Token Rhythm platform, China); testers accessed it through the Pi open-source AI agent framework. No vendor identity announced.
- **Release / knowledge:** Listed and evaluation-published November 3, 2026 (techgogogo evaluation report). No release announcement from any named vendor.
- **IDs:** No official model ID published in fetched sources (referred to only as "Egg Alpha" in the picker).
- **Context window:** 1M context claimed by the evaluation report (single secondary source; the platform's own models page is JavaScript-rendered and did not display this entry when fetched).
- **Modalities:** Reasoning + image and video input per the evaluation report; output text (SVG/UI tasks in the informal test). Not vendor-documented.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Input/output temporarily 0 元 (free) per the evaluation report — provisional, not on a vendor price page.
- **Architecture:** Unknown (anonymous).

### Raw benchmarks found

- Every standard benchmark row reads **no verified public score found**: no GPQA / HLE / AIME / SWE-bench / Terminal-Bench / MMMU / AA Intelligence Index / Arena entry exists for this model, and no leaderboard tracks it.
- The only public testing is one informal, ad-hoc six-task evaluation (2026-11-03, techgogogo, run at maximum thinking depth via a borrowed key on Pi): constrained instruction-following sentence generation (one ending error, two sentences awkward), pelican-on-Saturn-rings SVG (near-clean, slightly behind a top Claude Opus 5.5 demo), compound-bow archery SVG (minor parabola issue), browser-OS UI build (functional, minor polish issues), 3D racing game (functional, crude car model), dependency-free Trello board (clean). These are informal creative tasks, not measured benchmarks — no numeric scores attach to them.
- Terminal-Bench 2.1 / 4.x / Tau3-Banking / GDPval-AA / Claw-Eval / Toolathon / MCP-Atlas: no verified public score found.
- GPQA Diamond / HLE / LCR / CritPt / AA Intelligence Index / Omniscience: no verified public score found.
- SWE-bench Verified / LiveCodeBench / SciCode / Vibe Code Bench / DeepSWE: no verified public score found.
- MRCR / RULER / GraphWalks: no verified public score found.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

Not computed — per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` SELF-EXCLUSION, a folder with zero verified public benchmark numbers must not carry a scored report; placeholder scores would corrupt the average. Saved as `.md.excluded` (notes only; scores inside are ignored by `pnpm sync`). If the model's vendor is revealed or benchmark numbers are published, this file can be replaced by a fresh scored report.

